			"id": "agent-analysis-abilitycommon-har-shell",
			"interpretation": "Holds the HAR at features/abilitycommon consumed downstream as @ohos/abilitycommon. Index.ets re-exports BaseAbilityHelper, FormAbilityHelper, HomeView, SplashView, TABS_LIST/TabBarData. module.json5 declares type=har, routerMap=$profile:router_map, deviceTypes {default,tablet,2in1}; build-profile.json5 defines six hvigor targets (default,dev,uat,prod,beta,ohosTest) with per-target resource overlays. BaseAbilityHelper wires UIAbility lifecycle (appRecovery, colorMode, Want via PullUpManager, loadContent SplashPage, Web/Window init, AppStorage PageContexts). FormAbilityHelper implements FormExtensionAbility callbacks, routing by formName (ArticleServiceCard, hmos_3d_live_widget) to UpdateFormData and 3D live overflow. HomeView builds an HdsTabs shell of four TabContents and forwards them via MainPageViewModel to sibling features. SplashViewModel coordinates InitCenter.initBefore/AfterAgreement, first-start gating via PreferenceManager, then jumps to MAIN_PAGE. Dependencies are file links to common/commonbusiness/componentlibrary/devpractices/exploration/mine/widgetcommon plus @kit.* AbilityKit/BasicServicesKit/ArkUI/FormKit/UIDesignKit. Tests live under src/test and src/ohosTest.",
